-- ============================================================
-- Version     : V202
-- Description : Seed real reference data for AAYURDHARA HOSPITAL,
--               read from the pharmacy's legacy report exports
--               (Suppliers, Medicine Stock, Purchase Orders,
--               Purchase/GRN) under temp/ at the repo root:
--                 - suppliers: all 30 real suppliers
--                 - medicines + medicine_batches: all medicines
--                   and batches from the current stock report,
--                   seeded as opening stock (one stock_ledger_entries
--                   RECEIPT row per batch)
--                 - purchase_orders + purchase_order_items: every
--                   real purchase order line whose medicine also
--                   appears in the stock report (so a real rate is
--                   available) - the PO report itself has no
--                   pricing columns, so rate/amount are backfilled
--                   from that medicine's average current stock rate
--                   (tax_percent=0, as the source has no tax data)
--                 - purchases: all 96 real GRN invoices at header
--                   level (grn_number/supplier/dates/financials) -
--                   the GRN report has no line-item detail at all,
--                   so purchase_items is intentionally left empty
--                   for these; nothing in the schema requires items
--                   to exist for a purchase header to be valid
-- Author      : LockDoc App
-- ============================================================

